  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Apollo Moda is a premium streetwear brand launching Summer 2026. We design heavyweight, oversized garments built around classical and mythological references — think Icarus, Medusa, Apollo. Every piece is made to be worn, photographed, and remembered. Our current range includes graphic tees, crewneck sweatshirts, hoodies, sweatpants, and shorts, all produced in limited quantities at premium quality.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Apollo Moda sits at the intersection of streetwear and classical art. Our graphics aren't trend-chasing — they carry meaning, narrative, and visual weight. We produce in limited drops, keep our community tight, and price our product honestly. If you wear it, people will ask about it.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Affiliates earn a commission on every sale generated through their unique link. Commission is tracked automatically and paid out monthly. The more you drive, the more you earn — there's no cap.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>The best way to promote Apollo Moda is authentically — wear the product, post it, talk about it. Content that performs well includes outfit shots, unboxing, styling videos, and honest reviews. We're a visual brand so photography and video content tends to convert best.</p><p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We provide affiliates with early access to new drops, product gifting for top performers, and creative assets on request. This is a ground-floor opportunity — we're growing fast and want the right people growing with us.</p></div></div>",
